<title>MALAYSIA: Tan Chong 1996 net at 259.79 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Tan Chong 1996 net at 259.79 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    259.79     vs	  135.17</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)    38.7	vs	   20.0</p>
<p>    Turnover	   2,831.40	vs	2,424.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit     383.18	vs	  203.76</p>
<p>    Minorities    less   1.63	vs   less   1.86</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	0.93	vs	    0.77</p>
<p>    Final div  (pct)    12.0	 vs	    6.0</p>
<p>NOTES - Tan Chong Motor Holdings Bhd assembles Nissan cars.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
